  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migration and Development Initiatives: Italian Voluntary Contribution 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s overall objective is to foster the enabling conditions for migration to contribute to transformative pathways for sustainable development. This will be achieved by: a) enhancing migrants&#x2019;, diasporic actors&#x2019; and their partners&#x2019; transformative capacities and contributions to sustainable development (through capacity building, grants and opportunities for organizational development and the analysis of lessons learned); and b) strengthening transformative pathways for sustainable development in the Mediterranean through evidence, dialogue and cooperation (enhancing research and opportunities for facilitating strategic dialogue among key stakeholders at international level). Throughout its design and implementation, the project embeds key priorities for the Italian development cooperation, such as health, gender equality, the humanitarian-peace-development-nexus, the green transition, food systems sustainability, and climate action.</narrative>
  </description>
